### Event Gateway API - Happy Path Requests
### Run with the IntelliJ HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client.
### If Account Service is unavailable, the first POST returns 202 instead of 201,
### but the event is still stored and can be retrieved/listed.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@registry = http://localhost:8761
@eventId = a80304ad-384a-4da4-aa3f-1c50fb2df311
@debitEventId = bb9711b1-6aa1-4453-b850-ed9f356cb42b
@accountId = acct-http-123

### Gateway actuator health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Eureka registry applications
GET {{registry}}/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### Event Gateway registration in Eureka
GET {{registry}}/eureka/apps/EVENT-GATEWAY-API
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs

### OpenAPI YAML
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs.yaml

### Submit a random CREDIT event
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{$uuid}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:02:11Z",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "http-client",
    "batchId": "B-9042"
  }
}

### Submit the same event again - exact duplicate should return 200 EVENT_DUPLICATE
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:02:11Z",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "http-client",
    "batchId": "B-9042"
  }
}

### Submit a DEBIT event
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{debitEventId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": 25.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:05:00Z",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "http-client",
    "reason": "fee"
  }
}

### Retrieve one event by id
GET {{host}}/events/{{eventId}}

### List events for account
GET {{host}}/events?account={{accountId}}

### Get account balance through Event Gateway
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance

### Get account details through Event Gateway
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}
